Description: Fix GHSA-8h8q-6873-q5fj / CVE-2026-23870 — bound work when
 reconstructing FormData ($K) references during React Server Components
 request deserialization. Caps cumulative backing-store scan budget across
 all FormData references within one reply. Applied to all dist/compiled
 react-server-dom-{webpack,turbopack}{,-experimental} server bundles
 (browser/edge/node/unbundled, development/production/production.min).
 Adapted from the 14.2.24/14.2.26 nearby-version patches onto next 14.2.18
 after GHSA-5j59-xgg2-r9c4 so minified context matches.
 The supplied GHSA-8h8q file was the cyclic-thenable change (GHSA-5j59),
 not the FormData scan-budget fix.
Origin: nearby-backport, GHSA-8h8q-6873-q5fj
Author: Root.io Novel Patcher <security@root.io>
Last-Update: 2026-09-11

